+class TestTimezoneConventionIsUniform:
+    """QS-9: the package must drop timezones one way everywhere. Dropping the
+    zone keeps the local timestamp, so a bar keeps its own trading date; the
+    result must therefore match the wall-clock-naive equivalent exactly."""
